Command-line tools

Install:
  Install or update catalog packages and install missing isolated uv tools; prepare uv when missing. Use the official GitHub CLI repository.

Upgrade:
  Update catalog packages, uv and isolated uv tools; install missing components. Use the official GitHub CLI repository.

Status:
  Group installed versions by purpose; APT candidates use the local index.

Requirements:
  Ubuntu, APT and a regular user with sudo access.

Configuration:
  Prepare uv when missing; uv selects or downloads Python for each tool.
  The Python module is not required.
